1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,900
Xitoyda — olti yuz to'qson to'qqiz yuan.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,400
Uyingizgacha qanchaga tushadi?

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,400
Boj? Kargo? Kurs? Kuryer?

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,900
Javob — bitta skrinshotda.

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:15,400
Bu — Pochtam. Global xaridlar biz bilan oson.

6
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:20,400
Rasmini yuklang — sun'iy intellekt tovarni do'konlardan topadi.

7
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:26,400
Narxni skrinshot qiling — ilova boj, kargo va kurs bilan jami summani chiqaradi.

8
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:31,400
Narx tarkibi ochiq. Oyiga ikki yuz dollargacha — bojsiz.

9
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:35,400
Butun savatni ham bitta skrinshot bilan hisoblang.

10
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:39,900
Eng arzon kuryerni tanlang — u siz uchun sotib oladi.

11
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:43,900
Yetti do'kon uchun — qadam-baqadam qo'llanma.

12
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,400
Jo'natmangizni eshigingizgacha kuzating.

13
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:51,900
Qirq uch do'kon. Yigirma kuryer. Uch til.

14
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,900
Hammasi — bitta ilovada.

15
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:59,900
Orzuingiz — eshigingiz oldida.

16
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:03,400
Pochtam. Orzu qiling — qolganini biz hal qilamiz.

17
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:05,900
Pochtam nuqta uz.
